# Everything the build does not need. A smaller context is a faster, more cacheable build —
# and node_modules must never be copied in, or the install layer is meaningless.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
test-results
**/test-results
.git
.github
docs
e2e
infra/terraform
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
